Third-party attributions

This product includes software derived from CodeChat WhatsApp API
(https://github.com/code-chat-br/whatsapp-api), originally licensed under MIT.
The CodeChat project implemented the Baileys library
(https://github.com/WhiskeySockets/Baileys), which ARGWS Connect API also uses for
its WhatsApp Web integration.

This product integrates Zapo (`@innovatorssoft/zapo-js`) for WhatsApp protocol
capabilities and `wa-store-migrate` for explicit provider session conversion.
Both are used under their respective open-source licenses and remain separate
third-party projects.
